cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: ColonyCounter
abstract: >-
  Quantification of colony formation (clonogenic) assays from flatbed scans of crystal
  violet stained multi-well plates: well detection, optical-density based colony
  segmentation with edge handling, a fillable plate map for any experimental layout,
  design-aware statistics and publication figures.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Frangou
    given-names: Spencer W.
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Cell and Cancer Biology, College of Medicine and Life
      Sciences, The University of Toledo, Toledo, OH, USA
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23780010
repository-code: "https://github.com/SpencerFrangou/ColonyCounter"
keywords:
  - clonogenic assay
  - colony formation
  - crystal violet
  - image analysis
  - cancer biology
